+### Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=sh-dv%2Fhat.sh)
+
+Wasmer runs `npm install` and `npm run build` (which runs `next export`), then serves the generated `out` folder as static files; encryption still happens entirely in the visitor's browser. The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the configuration and click Deploy; it does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account. To customize the app and redeploy on every push, fork this repository and import your own repository on Wasmer.
